    "icon_boxes_MMYFK8": {
      "type": "icon-boxes",
      "blocks": {
        "icon_box_YbyFUa": {
          "type": "_icon-box",
          "name": "t:names.icon_box",
          "settings": {
            "text_align": "center",
            "icon": "waves",
            "icon_image_upload": "shopify://shop_images/Lumeia_Normalized_Icon_Graphics_03_Collagen_Power.png",
            "icon_size": "custom-size",
            "icon_width": 76,
            "icon_width_mobile": 56,
            "link": "",
            "heading": "OmniCol™ 120 Hydrolysed Bovine Collagen Peptides",
            "heading_preset": "h5",
            "text": "<p>The most abundant protein in your body, about 30% of all your protein. It's the key building block found in skin, bones, tendons and ligaments. After 25, you lose roughly 1-1.5% a year. This is what you're replacing. Lumeia uses collagen that is broken down small enough to reach your bloodstream.</p>",
            "inherit_color_scheme": false,
            "color_scheme": "scheme-3",
            "border_radius": 20
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "icon_box_ce79qJ": {
          "type": "_icon-box",
          "name": "t:names.icon_box",
          "settings": {
            "text_align": "center",
            "icon": "waves",
            "icon_image_upload": "shopify://shop_images/Lumeia_Normalized_Icon_Graphics_06_High_Protein.png",
            "icon_size": "custom-size",
            "icon_width": 76,
            "icon_width_mobile": 56,
            "link": "",
            "heading": "Whey Protein Concentrate",
            "heading_preset": "h5",
            "text": "<p>A complete protein with all nine essential amino acids your body needs to build and maintain itself. The amino acid profile in whey is the closest match to what your body actually uses. Protein contributes to a growth in muscle mass and to the maintenance of normal bones.</p>",
            "inherit_color_scheme": false,
            "color_scheme": "scheme-3",
            "border_radius": 20
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "icon_box_eETYwz": {
          "type": "_icon-box",
          "name": "t:names.icon_box",
          "settings": {
            "text_align": "center",
            "icon": "tag",
            "icon_image_upload": "shopify://shop_images/Lumeia_Normalized_Icon_Graphics_13_Vitamin_C.png",
            "icon_size": "custom-size",
            "icon_width": 76,
            "icon_width_mobile": 56,
            "link": "",
            "heading": "Vitamin C",
            "heading_preset": "h5",
            "text": "<p>Your body needs Vitamin C to form new collagen. It's not optional, since without it, collagen production stalls. 100% of your daily recommended value in every Complete Collagen sachet.</p>",
            "inherit_color_scheme": false,
            "color_scheme": "scheme-3",
            "border_radius": 20
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "icon_box_wM8FMy": {
          "type": "_icon-box",
          "name": "t:names.icon_box",
          "settings": {
            "text_align": "center",
            "icon": "tag",
            "icon_image_upload": "shopify://shop_images/Lumeia_Normalized_Icon_Graphics_02_Skin_Hydration.png",
            "icon_size": "custom-size",
            "icon_width": 76,
            "icon_width_mobile": 56,
            "link": "",
            "heading": "Hyaluronic Acid",
            "heading_preset": "h5",
            "text": "<p>Holds up to 1,000 times its weight in water. Locks moisture into your skin from the inside. 100mg daily, the amount in each Complete Collagen sachet, has been shown to improve skin hydration within 4 to 8 weeks.</p>",
            "inherit_color_scheme": false,
            "color_scheme": "scheme-3",
            "border_radius": 20
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "icon_box_gbFVGt": {
          "type": "_icon-box",
          "name": "t:names.icon_box",
          "settings": {
            "text_align": "center",
            "icon": "tag",
            "icon_image_upload": "shopify://shop_images/Lumeia_Normalized_Icon_Graphics_10_Hair_and_Nails.png",
            "icon_size": "custom-size",
            "icon_width": 76,
            "icon_width_mobile": 56,
            "link": "",
            "heading": "Biotin + Zinc Bisglycinate",
            "heading_preset": "h5",
            "text": "<p>Biotin is a B-vitamin involved in keratin production, the protein your hair and nails are built from. Zinc supports the repair processes that keep skin, hair, and nails healthy. Both are in your Complete Collagen sachet.</p>",
            "inherit_color_scheme": false,
            "color_scheme": "scheme-3",
            "border_radius": 20
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "icon_box_UFqfBq": {
          "type": "_icon-box",
          "name": "t:names.icon_box",
          "settings": {
            "text_align": "center",
            "icon": "tag",
            "icon_image_upload": "shopify://shop_images/Lumeia_Normalized_Icon_Graphics_24_Digestive_Enzymes.png",
            "icon_size": "custom-size",
            "icon_width": 76,
            "icon_width_mobile": 56,
            "link": "",
            "heading": "Bromelain + Lactase Enzymes",
            "heading_preset": "h5",
            "text": "<p>Lactose is the number one cause of bloating with protein powders. Lactase breaks it down before it reaches your gut, so the protein sits comfortably from the first Thrive Protein sachet. Helping this, bromelain, a natural enzyme from pineapple, breaks protein into smaller pieces your body can use.</p>",
            "inherit_color_scheme": false,
            "color_scheme": "scheme-3",
            "border_radius": 20
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
