                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "text": "<p>Each Lumeia products has its unique benefits, yet they complement each other. Complete Collagen is your skin ritual (10,500mg collagen + 9 supporting ingredients). Thrive Protein is your body ritual (22-23g protein + 1,500mg collagen + botanicals and digestive enzymes). Many women use Collagen in the morning and Protein after activity or as a snack.</p>",
